<li>
	<p>A templated restaurant website built with Python. The project had four initial themes. The build comprised html and sass/scss, javascript for menu behaviors (hide and show), which menu displays based on time of day, which day of the week is highlighted in the Hours section, and the slow scroll and inactive areas for the navigation. The project has a grunt/node/Django backend, I wrote pieces for the model view and admin area as well.</p>
